        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shafter%2C_California"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Minter Field opened in 1941, saw heavy WWII use, and later hosted the 1977 Gossamer Condor human‑powered flight.",
